  "content": "<h2>No More Noses - Деревенские и/или Разбойники</h2>\n<p>Ресурспак, который убирает носы у человекоподобных мобов Minecraft (за исключением ведьм).</p>\n<h3><strong>Доступно 3 разные версии:</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1386745/description_e11022a1-fc74-448b-9ec6-e7d41ef4328d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>NoMoreNoses Villagers</strong>, удаляет носы у деревенских жителей, зомби-жителей, странствующих торговцев и железных големов.</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1386745/description_9f22abc4-7821-4d5d-9398-d323eec8904e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>NoMoreNoses Pillagers</strong>, применяется только к носам разбойников.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1386745/description_7c342431-9199-45a0-809c-75e94637a1c1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong>NoMoreNoses с двигающимися руками,</strong> то же самое, что nomorenoses, но с <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/villagers-with-moving-arms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">двигающимися руками</a>. (требует установки следующих двух модов)</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[EMF] Entity Model Features [Fabric &amp; NeoForge]</a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[ETF] Entity Texture Features - [Fabric &amp; NeoForge]</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Таким образом, вы можете выбрать удаление носов только у деревенских жителей, только у разбойников или у обоих.</p>\n<p>Пакеты поддерживают многих мобов из других модов.</p>\n<p>Список мобов, совместимых с <strong>NoMoreNoses Villagers</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bakery-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bakery Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountiful-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bountiful Villager</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/desert-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Desert Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diamond-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Diamond Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/end-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">End Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/garbage-collector-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Garbage Collector Villager</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villagers-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guard Villagers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guard Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/homesteads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Homesteads</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hunter-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hunter Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jungle-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jungle Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/leaf-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Leaf Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lush-cave-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lush Cave Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monster-hunter-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Monster Hunter Villager</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-traders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Traders</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Villagers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mushroom-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mushroom Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-villager-merchant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether Merchant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ocean-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ocean Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plains-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plains Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/railcraft-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Railcraft Reborn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Recruits</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sawmill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sawmill</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trial-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trial Villagers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-enchanter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Enchanter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Plus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visiting-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visiting Villagers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/workers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Workers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">XP Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zeldasorceresss-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zelda Sorceress's Villager</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Список мобов, совместимых с <strong>NoMoreNoses Pillagers</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchant-with-mob\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchant With Mob</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends and Foes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-illagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guard illagers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/homeless-illager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Homeless Illager</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/huntersreturn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hunters Return</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-chef-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Illager Chef</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Illager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mischief-illagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mischief illagers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mobz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mobz</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mushroom-illager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mushroom illager</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillagersplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pillager Plus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/raider-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raider Expansion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"The Pillager Legion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Pillager Legion</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1386745/description_873d3f0c-0a74-453a-9940-126984533573.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"180\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
